    <releaseNotes> V16.5 RELEASE (Build 3215) - 2026-09-11

 ADDED - WebView and what formats should be opened in WebView can now be configured in Options in FileViewer.
 FIXED - Linked navigation now works again. Can be enabled from View mode popup.
 FIXED - Delete did not update parent folder size if folder had been calculated before.
 ADDED - 10+ Stability issues
 
 ADDED -  ==========================================================
          MultiCommander is now digitally signed. The installer and all program
          files are code signed, so Windows shows the publisher name instead of
          the "Unknown publisher" warning, and security software is less likely
          to block them. Funded entirely by user donations - thank you!
         ==========================================================</releaseNotes>
